ated during the outage and has a holding/delay mechanism applied will be lo=
st. The already scheduled Time Initiated Actions (TIA's) will be delayed an=
d processed post outage (including check-in-related events).</li>
=09=09=09=09<li><strong>Amadeus Central Reservation =E2=80=93 Queues (QUE)<=
